  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "By default, when you drop a sharing pedestal, it's marked as visible to public in the UI. However, when you actually drop it, you'll find most non-friends can't see it. There is, of course, a setting in the quick menu to control whether you see sharing pedestals from non-friends, but if you don't know this, it turns into a very confusing experience for everyone involved.\n\nWhile I can understand the goal of wanting to have some controls to protect against other users spamming interactables in your face, having at least some kind of indication that there is something there, and some guidance to direct users to the relevant setting would be appreciated.",
